# Dear neighbors {.title}

*Carroll Gardens · Thursday, October 15*

The stoop sale is on for Saturday, rain or shine. Bring what you no longer need and a folding table if you have one.

## What we still need

- [ ] Someone with a van, for the leftovers to Housing Works
- [x] A coffee urn, borrowed from the church on Court Street
- [ ] Chalk for the sidewalk signs

## Money

Item | Cost:money
--- | ---
Permit | 25
Signs | 12
Coffee and cups | 40
Total | =SUM(B1:B3)

Whatever we make goes to the community fridge on Smith Street.^[Last year: $612, in a coffee can.]
